branch('WB10',[82,83,84],'Header context and native ownership','Header editing has its own status and no ordinary document page indicator; source limits a header to one page. Automatic trailing blank line/header height reduces body space. InsertPageNumber uses special ^B owner, not literal AB from OCR. Header return and body return are distinct.',['Q1','Q2','Q3'])
