branch('WB10',[86,87],'Sort default and exact block boundary','If Sort menu is not SortByLine choose Type7 then Line2. Both lists have distinct inclusive title boundaries. These ordinary text-list sorts are not a proof of every CMD51-135 secondary-record/disk-key mode or A5ColumnMath.',['Q1','Q2','Q3'])
