branch('WB11',[89,90],'Directory and disposable media preconditions','File exercise assumes harddisk setup plus extra formatted disposable disketteA; other setup uses Appendix reference, not expanded here. WBC323 replaces obsolete formatting-appendix reference with DOSmanual. F5 default directory may require OtherDirectory7; no real media/path action was performed.',['O2','Q1','Q2','Q3'])
