branch('WB11',[91,92,93],'Marks survive copy and destructive confirmation','Asterisk marking advances current selection. Copy retains marks; unmark MEMO before deleting other marked files. Two deletion confirmations are separate. Prior verified copies are source premise, not evidence of actual successful disk writes here.',['Q1','Q2','Q3'])
