branch('WB11',[95,96],'Normal exit, abnormal startup and historical shell','NormalExit removes temporary files. Source describes abnormal-start running-instance question and stale temporary-file cleanup; never simulated or applied here. Startupbackup Rename/Delete context is separate from timedbackup recovery. WBC1637 changes historicalLibrary return example toWordPerfectOfficeShell. Pictured separateapplications and advice are documentary, not new implementation/launch obligations.',['O2','S2','Q1','Q2','Q3'])
