branch('WB12',[99,100,101,102],'Fixed and proportional metrics','ADDRESS.WKB, WorkbookPrinter and actual selectable fonts/PRS are prerequisites. Equal30-character lines atCourier10cpi versus unequal widths atHelvetica12pt distinguish print geometry from equal editing cells. WBC363 corrects prose10pt to12pt and WBC81 corrects W-line Pos7in to5.2in; i-line2.65in remains resource-specific source example.',['L1','L2','P1','P3','Q2','Q3'])
