branch('WB12',[106],'Memory copy empty filename route','SaveF10Enter with no filename retains selected block in memory; RetrieveShiftF10Enter with no filename inserts it. Memory lasts untilapp exit. Prose about replacing memory with Enter is abbreviated: do not infer arbitrary bareEnter refresh semantics without exact UI context. MoveCopy is separate alternative.',['E3','Q1','Q2','Q3'])
